WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.982
The Opportunity Map has six parts: opportunity, fit,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.951
evidence, gap, people, and next step. Compare three

00:00:08.998 --> 00:00:12.516
supplied fictional options. The current-setting option is to

00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:15.616
seek permitted internal review of the bounded intake

00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:19.436
prototype. The evidence fits, but the actual reviewer

00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:22.779
and permission must be established. The adjacent option

00:00:22.837 --> 00:00:24.904
is a review of another request type using

00:00:24.985 --> 00:00:27.899
safe examples; that type has not been tested.

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:32.520
The longer-term possibility is broader workflow support, which

00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:35.747
needs much more experience and evidence. Choose a

00:00:35.805 --> 00:00:39.172
primary and a backup with reasons. A review

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:42.809
conversation may be appropriate before a pilot. Do

00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:45.154
not present a fictional tabletop as an approved

00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:48.312
operational service, or treat AI's comparison as a

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.622
promise of clients, income, or employment.
